echo "=== ARCHIVOS PYTHON DEL BOT ==="
find /root -name "*.py" -not -path "*cobratelo*" -not -path "*__pycache__*" -not -path "*ayuda-es-agent*" 2>/dev/null | sort

echo ""
echo "=== GREP normalized_qty ==="
grep -rn "normalized_qty\|free_base\|EXCHANGE_SUBMIT" /root --include="*.py" \
  --exclude-dir=cobratelo --exclude-dir=ayuda-es-agent --exclude-dir=__pycache__ 2>/dev/null

echo ""
echo "=== PROCESOS BOT ACTIVOS ==="
ps aux | grep python | grep -v grep
